{
  "project": {
    "name": "Parametric Project Enclosure",
    "slug": "electronics-enclosure",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A Hammond-style two-part project box for electronics, sized by its interior cavity to a PCB. The base carries corner PCB standoffs bored for M2.5 or M3 screws, optional rectangular side-port cutouts, and optional vent slots; the lid closes with either screw tabs or a snap lip.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Una caja de proyecto estilo Hammond en dos partes para electrónica, dimensionada por su cavidad interior a una PCB. La base lleva soportes (standoffs) en las esquinas de la placa, perforados para tornillos M2.5 o M3, cortes rectangulares laterales opcionales para puertos y ranuras de ventilación opcionales; la tapa cierra con pestañas atornilladas o un labio a presión.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/electronics-enclosure.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": ["enclosure", "project-box", "electronics", "hammond", "pcb", "case", "hyperobject", "commons"],
    "hyperobject": { "is_hyperobject": true },
    "force_backend": true
  },
  "modes": [
